ing instance count to actual demand. ElastiCache reduces redundant database queries and associated compute. CloudFront's edge caching reduces long-haul data transfer and origin compute. Right-sizing to t3.small (vs. over-provisioning to larger instances) minimizes resource consumption while meeting performance targets.",
